# Six data rows: three valid, three each violating one check.
# gpu-ok:      mode=gpu, ngpus set -> required_when satisfied
# gpu-missing: mode=gpu, ngpus empty -> required_when VIOLATED
# cpu-ok:      mode=cpu, ngpus not required, threads within bound
# bad-compare: ngpus > threads -> compare VIOLATED (ngpus <= threads)
# dup-output:  output_dir repeats cpu-ok's -> file-level unique VIOLATED
# extra-row exists only to make row_count's minimum meaningful
run_id|input_file|output_dir|mode|threads|ngpus
gpu-ok|data/a.dat|out/gpu-ok|gpu|8|2
gpu-missing|data/b.dat|out/gpu-missing|gpu|8|
cpu-ok|data/c.dat|out/cpu-ok|cpu|4|
bad-compare|data/a.dat|out/bad-compare|gpu|2|4
dup-output|data/b.dat|out/cpu-ok|cpu|4|
